@startuml "Visitor - Factory - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title A health check for every employee, and for the boss
class Employee {
  + accept(Visitor)
}
class Manager
class Director
class Engineer
class Secretary
class Boss {
  + accept(Visitor)
}
interface Visitor {
  + visit(Employee)
  + visit(Boss)
}
class HealthVisitor
class Company {
  + setVisitor(Visitor)
}
Employee <|-- Manager
Manager <|-- Director
Employee <|-- Engineer
Employee <|-- Secretary
Visitor <|.. HealthVisitor
Company o--> "*" Employee
note bottom of Boss
  Not an Employee: a visitor can
  visit classes with no common parent.
end note
note bottom of HealthVisitor
  One visit(Employee) for four classes,
  so it tests instanceof Manager.
end note
@enduml
